            "title": "Does Telix (ASX:TLX) Advancing TLX591 Trial Quietly Redefine Its Global Oncology Ambitions?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Telix Pharmaceuticals recently confirmed that Part 1 of its ProstACT Global Phase 3 trial of TLX591 in metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer has completed enrolment and that the study has moved into Part 2, with patients now being dosed across several countries. This update not only corrects inaccurate market speculation but also signals continued global expansion plans for TLX591, including intended FDA engagement and a prospective European Medicines Agency clinical trial...",
